<title>USA: Invacare says Healthdyne wait period ends.</title>
<headline>Invacare says Healthdyne wait period ends.</headline>
<dateline>ELYRIA, Ohio 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invacare Corp Tuesday said that the waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Act for its cash tender offer for Healthdyne Technologies Inc for $13 per share expired last Friday.</p>
<p>The tender offer is currently set to expire February 24.</p>
</text>
